<title>USA: Exxon Corp wins aviation fuel contract.</title>
<headline>Exxon Corp wins aviation fuel contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense Department said on Wednesday that it has awarded a $114.6 million contract to the Exxon Corp for JP8 and JP5 aviation turbine fuels.</p>
<p>It said the fuel is to be supplied from Benicia, Calif., through April 30 next year.</p>
